{"summary":"印纸是古代带有官府印迹的纸张，性味平和，将印迹处剪下烧灰，水服一钱匕，可使妇人避孕无子。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"令妇人断产无子，剪有印处烧灰，水服一钱匕效（藏器）。","translation":"使妇人断绝生育而不生子，剪下有印迹的部分烧成灰，用水送服一钱匕即有效。（陈藏器）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#印紙","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}